00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:13.467 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ ♪ ♪

00:00:11.133 --> 00:00:14.700 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Et visiblement, la course ne

00:00:12.333 --> 00:00:15.933 size:53% position:73% line:53%
