une campagne tranquille.

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:18.567 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Pourtant, dans le cas

00:00:24.833 --> 00:00:26.633 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Des électeurs désintéressés,

00:00:28.633 --> 00:00:31.833 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Des électeurs désintéressés,

00:00:29.833 --> 00:00:32.833 size:53% position:73% line:53%
une campagneraranquille.

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.867 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Pourtant, dans le cas

00:00:31.933 --> 00:00:34.900 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de Toronto, ce n'est pas

00:00:32.933 --> 00:00:39.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
faute de candidats, avec

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:40.233 size:53% position:73% line:53%
une trentaine de personnes

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.233 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qui convoitent la mairie.

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:42.267 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Mais ces nombreuses

00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:43.300 size:53% position:73% line:53%
candidatures ont été éclipsées

00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:47.000 size:53% position:73% line:53%
par celle du maire sortant,

00:00:42.367 --> 00:00:48.000 size:53% position:73% line:53%
John Tory, qui brigue

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:48.033 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un troisième mandat.

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:49.033 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Dans son quartier général,

00:00:48.133 --> 00:00:51.067 size:53% position:73% line:53%
quelques bénévoles font

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:52.100 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des appels, pendant que

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:53.133 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le maire lit son journal.

00:00:51.167 --> 00:00:54.167 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Ici, on ne sent pas

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:55.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'effervescence qui règne

00:00:53.233 --> 00:00:56.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
souvent dans les bureaux de

00:00:54.267 --> 00:01:01.100 size:53% position:73% line:53%
campagne, car l'équipe Tory

00:00:55.300 --> 00:01:01.100 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sait qu'elle mène largement

00:00:56.300 --> 00:01:01.100 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dans les sondages.

00:01:02.967 --> 00:01:05.967 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Le maire sortant fait le pari

00:01:03.967 --> 00:01:07.000 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que l'électorat voudra miser

00:01:05.033 --> 00:01:08.033 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sur son expérience.

00:01:06.033 --> 00:01:09.067 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- - If I hadn't produced any

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:10.067 size:53% position:73% line:53%
results, I wouldn't even be a

00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:11.100 size:53% position:73% line:53%
competitive candidate for mayor.

00:01:09.167 --> 00:01:12.100 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- "Si je n'avais pas produit

00:01:10.167 --> 00:01:16.900 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de résultats, je ne serais

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:17.900 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pas un candidat compétitif",

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:18.933 size:53% position:73% line:53%
affirme John Tory.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.967 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Le maire sortant se targue

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.967 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'oioir livré la marchandise.

00:01:19.033 --> 00:01:22.000 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mais ce constat est loin d'être

00:01:20.067 --> 00:01:23.033 size:53% position:73% line:53%
partagé par tous les Torontois.

00:01:21.067 --> 00:01:24.267 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Beaucoup ont plutôt l'impression

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:26.300 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que leur ville peine à offrir

00:01:23.133 --> 00:01:28.300 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les services de base :

00:01:24.367 --> 00:01:30.333 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pénurie de logements,

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:32.367 size:53% position:73% line:53%
rues sales, nids de poule,

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:34.400 size:53% position:73% line:53%
manque de pistes cyclables

00:01:30.433 --> 00:01:36.400 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et transports publics laborieux.

00:01:32.467 --> 00:01:38.467 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- When I actually look

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:40.467 size:53% position:73% line:53%
at his policies, they are

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:42.500 size:53% position:73% line:53%
not that progressive.

00:01:38.567 --> 00:01:44.533 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- "Ses politiques ne sont

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:46.533 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pas assez progressistes",

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:47.767 size:53% position:73% line:53%
croit cette Torontoise.

00:01:44.633 --> 00:01:49.000 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- What can the city do

00:01:46.633 --> 00:01:50.233 size:53% position:73% line:53%
to make...

00:01:47.867 --> 00:01:51.433 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Des reprhehes que John Tory

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:52.667 size:53% position:73% line:53%
a aussi entendus de la part de

00:01:50.333 --> 00:01:53.700 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ses rivaux, qui l'ont souvent

00:01:51.533 --> 00:01:54.733 size:53% position:73% line:53%
accusé de manquer d'ambition.

00:01:52.767 --> 00:01:55.767 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "Il n'a rien fait en huit ans

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:56.800 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et le logementbobordable

00:01:54.833 --> 00:01:57.800 size:53% position:73% line:53%
est un échec", a lancé

00:01:55.867 --> 00:01:58.833 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le principal rival de

00:01:56.900 --> 00:01:59.867 size:53% position:73% line:53%
John Tory, Gil Penalosa.

00:01:57.900 --> 00:02:00.900 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Yes, there are problems,

00:01:58.933 --> 00:02:01.933 size:53% position:73% line:53%
I'm not satisfied.

00:01:59.967 --> 00:02:02.967 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- "O, , il y a des problèmes

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:04.000 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et je ne suis pas satisfait",

00:02:02.033 --> 00:02:05.000 size:53% position:73% line:53%
admet John Tory.

00:02:03.067 --> 00:02:06.000 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il promet toutefois de régler

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:06.033 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ces questions, qu'il attribue

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:07.067 size:53% position:73% line:53%
notamment à la pandémie.

00:02:06.133 --> 00:02:09.100 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Car Toronto se relève

00:02:07.167 --> 00:02:10.133 size:53% position:73% line:53%
difficilement de la crise.

00:02:08.167 --> 00:02:11.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
La métropole enregistre

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:12.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un déficit d'environ

00:02:10.233 --> 00:02:17.800 size:53% position:73% line:53%
1 milliard de dollars,

00:02:11.300 --> 00:02:18.800 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que le maire sortant promet de

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:19.833 size:53% position:73% line:53%
résorber sans hausse de taxes,

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:20.867 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et ce, mmeme si Toronto

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:26.633 size:53% position:73% line:53%
a l'un des taux d'imposition

00:02:19.933 --> 00:02:27.633 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les plus bas de la province.

00:02:20.967 --> 00:02:28.667 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- And if people think

00:02:26.733 --> 00:02:29.700 size:53% position:73% line:53%
they would like to pay more...

00:02:27.733 --> 00:02:30.733 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- "Si les gens veulent payer

00:02:28.767 --> 00:02:33.767 size:53% position:73% line:53%
plus de taxes, ils n'ont qu'à

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:34.800 size:53% position:73% line:53%
choisir un aut c candidat",

00:02:30.833 --> 00:02:35.800 size:53% position:73% line:53%
lance John Tory.

00:02:33.867 --> 00:02:36.833 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Nous suivons le maire sortant,

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:37.833 size:53% position:73% line:53%
alors qu'il fait campagne

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:38.867 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en banlie e ouest de Toronto.

00:02:36.933 --> 00:02:39.900 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Dans ce restaurant somalien,

00:02:37.933 --> 00:02:40.900 size:53% position:73% line:53%
John Tory est accueilli

00:02:38.967 --> 00:02:42.433 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en vedette.Ses promesses

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:47.333 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de réduire la violence armée

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:48.833 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et de garder les taxes basses

00:02:42.533 --> 00:02:50.367 size:53% position:73% line:53%
séduisent visiblement.

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:51.600 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- He built this city,

00:02:48.933 --> 00:02:52.833 size:53% position:73% line:53%
he creates jobs...

00:02:50.467 --> 00:02:54.000 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- "Il a bâti cette ville,

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:54.033 size:53% position:73% line:53%
créé des emplois. C'est

00:02:52.933 --> 00:02:55.267 size:53% position:73% line:53%
quelqu'un qui promouvoit

00:02:54.133 --> 00:03:01.533 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la diversité", explique

00:02:55.367 --> 00:03:02.767 size:53% position:73% line:53%
cette sympathisante.

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:04.000 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Deuxième arrêt de campagne

00:03:01.633 --> 00:03:05.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dans une épicerie perse

00:03:02.867 --> 00:03:06.233 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du nord de Toronto.

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:07.100 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Ici aussi, John Tory est

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:07.967 size:53% position:73% line:53%
entouré de visages amis et

00:03:06.333 --> 00:03:08.833 size:53% position:73% line:53%
essaie de conquérir les indécis.

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.733 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mais dans une allée,

00:03:08.067 --> 00:03:12.400 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un électeur l'intercepte.

00:03:08.933 --> 00:03:13.266 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Don't you think

00:03:09.833 --> 00:03:14.133 size:53% position:73% line:53%
that by endorsing...

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:15.000 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le citoyen reproche

00:03:13.367 --> 00:03:19.933 size:53% position:73% line:53%
au maire sortant de miner

00:03:14.233 --> 00:03:20.833 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la vie démocratique en se

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:21.733 size:53% position:73% line:53%
présentant une troisième fois.

00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:22.600 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- J'attends de lui

00:03:20.933 --> 00:03:27.833 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de comprendre ça et quand

00:03:21.833 --> 00:03:28.700 size:53% position:73% line:53%
c'est le temps de se retirer

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:29.600 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et donner la chance aux autres.

00:03:27.933 --> 00:03:30.467 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- John Tory est clair :

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:31.367 size:53% position:73% line:53%
cette campagne sera sa dernière.

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:32.233 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Twelve years is a asasonable

00:03:30.567 --> 00:03:35.767 size:53% position:73% line:53%
time, but it's also enough.

00:03:31.467 --> 00:03:36.633 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- "Douze ans, c'est assez",

00:03:32.333 --> 00:03:37.500 size:53% position:73% line:53%
croit le maire.

00:03:35.867 --> 00:03:38.400 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Ce seraitusussi un record

00:03:36.733 --> 00:03:39.266 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de longévité à la tête de

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:40.300 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la plus grande ville du Canada.

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:42.333 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mais pour ça, il faudra que

00:03:39.367 --> 00:03:44.333 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les électeurs choisissent

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:46.367 size:53% position:73% line:53%
encore John Tory. Et rien

00:03:42.433 --> 00:03:48.367 size:53% position:73% line:53%
n'est tout à fait joué

00:03:44.433 --> 00:03:48.800 size:53% position:73% line:53%
avant le 24 octobre.

00:03:46.467 --> 00:03:48.800 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Ici Yasmine Mehdi,

